{"id":"eef26124815f6232","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory.md","title":"Reflection Principle in Proof Theory","display":"thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory","aliases":["72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory"],"display":"thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Definition 10.3.4(1); printed p. 624; PDF p. 636; bounded metalinguistic variant supplied locally","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Direct range-of-function argument; external reflection only","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Definition 10.3.4(1); printed p. 624; PDF p. 636; bounded metalinguistic variant supplied locally"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Direct range-of-function argument; external reflection only"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\)</span> 是外部元语言谓词，不是某个未指定算术理论中的句子或可证性断言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(|\\pi|\\leq n\\to P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(|\\pi|\\leq n\\to P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Definition 10.3.4(1)，印刷页 624，PDF 页 636 定义算术反映原则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))\">\\(\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))\\)</span>；当前节点只给出其外部可靠性含义及按证明串长截断的版本。</li>\n<li>最后一式由 Cook–Reckhow 定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 直接推出，本次已经复核。不能据此外部真值推断弱算术理论证明了 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原书的算术公式复杂度、数值编码及 associated-theory 关系在这里没有形式化；本次不将外部总函数性质冒充为算术内部反映定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)$，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$ 及 $\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(|\\pi|\\leq n\\to P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)","display":false}],"bytes":2186,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory|thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory|thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory|72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["d9d13f2ac55f5a6d"]}